{"id":"a_hnlichkeit","lemma":"Ähnlichkeit","pos":"noun","rank":4694,"glosses":["similarity, resemblance"],"ipa":"/ˈɛːnlɪçkaɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6e/De-%C3%84hnlichkeit.ogg/De-%C3%84hnlichkeit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Ähnlichkeit","plural":"Ähnlichkeiten"},"examples":[{"text":"Der Ähnlichkeiten sind sehr viele.","en":"The similarities are many.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"}]},{"text":"Ich habe keine Vorstellung, womit es Ähnlichkeit hat.","en":"I have no idea of what it is like.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"idea"},{"g":"with what, what…with"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Erkennst du irgendwelche Ähnlichkeiten?","en":"Do you see any similarities?","words":[{"g":"to recognize, perceive","l":"erkennen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"any"},null]},{"text":"Ich war überrascht über seine große Ähnlichkeit mit seinem Vater.","en":"I was surprised at his strong resemblance to his father.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"surprised"},{"g":"[with accusative or…"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"big","l":"groß"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"father"}]},{"text":"Tom hat große Ähnlichkeit mit John.","en":"Tom looks a lot like John.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"big","l":"groß"},null,{"g":"with"},null]}]}